[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-walsh-scholarship-programme-2026-fully-funded-66":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},66,"walsh-scholarship-programme-2026-fully-funded-66","Walsh Scholarship Programme 2026 | Fully Funded","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested international students for the Walsh Scholarship Programme 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Walsh Scholarship Programme Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Teagasc\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Ireland\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fgrants\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Grants\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Annual grants of €24,000 per annum\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: March 18, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>alsh Scholarship Programme Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Walsh Scholarship Programme is Teagasc’s postgraduate development programme, with some 140 students pursuing PhD programmes at any one time. A budget of €3.65 million per annum is committed to the programme. There are up to 35 new places each year with a grant of €24,000 per annum.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The programme is called Walsh Scholars, to commemorate the late \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fteagasc.ie\u002Fabout\u002Fresearch--innovation\u002Fthe-walsh-scholars-programme\u002Fdr-tom-walsh\u002F#d.en.28063\">Dr Tom Walsh\u003C\u002Fa>, first Director of both the Agricultural Research Institute and the National Advisory and Training Service, which were merged to form Teagasc, and a prime mover in developing agricultural and food research in Ireland.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Walsh Scholarship Programme Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Successful applicants for the Walsh Scholarship Programme  2026 will be offered:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional development \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Grant of €24,000 per annum\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Walsh Scholarship Programme Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Walsh Scholarship Programme applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold, or expect to hold, an honours degree in Food Science or a related discipline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate an interest in functional foods, food processing, or food chemistry\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be motivated to undertake laboratory-based experimental research\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess strong organisational skills and the ability to analyse and interpret data\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have good written and verbal communication skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Relevant industry or internship experience is desirable\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All applicants, whose first language is not English, are required to have an International English Language Testing System (IELTS) score of &gt;6.0 or a Test of English as a Foreign Language (TOEFL) test score of &gt;92 (internet based).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must hold at least 2.1 Honours degree or equivalent in Food Science, Agriculture, Biotechnology, Business, Environmental Science, Economics, or a related discipline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Walsh Scholarship Programme Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Walsh Scholarship Programme, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelors\u002F Diploma Certificate (Masters)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English Language Proficiency \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fteagasc.ie\u002Fabout\u002Fresearch--innovation\u002Fthe-walsh-scholars-programme\u002Fwalsh-scholars-opportunities\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fteagasc.ie\u002Fabout\u002Fresearch--innovation\u002Fthe-walsh-scholars-programme\u002Fwalsh-scholars-opportunities\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-11 09:59:39",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fwalsh-scholarship-programme-2026-fully-funded\u002F69b12efbcb0c37.17839044_screenshot 2026-03-11 095305.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fwalsh-scholarship-programme-2026-fully-funded\u002F69b12efbcb0c37.17839044_screenshot%202026-03-11%20095305.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","M